{"seq":2,"slug":"engine-perf-profiling-benchmark","title":"向量化引擎性能剖析与基准度量","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/vectorized-query-execution-engine-simd/engine-implementation-ops/engine-perf-profiling-benchmark","wordCount":2589,"readingTime":11,"html":"<h1 id=\"向量化引擎性能剖析与基准度量\">向量化引擎性能剖析与基准度量</h1><p>一条跑在 32 核机器上的列式聚合，把批大小从 1024 调到 2048、算子从 AVX2 换成 AVX-512，吞吐只涨了 6%。优化不按预期兑现时，争论「是不是没走 SIMD」没有意义——你需要的是<strong>能定位到算子、能归因到硬件资源的证据</strong>。本文拆解三层度量工具：OS 级 PMU 计数器、引擎自带的算子级剖析器、跨引擎可比的基准套件。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>向量化引擎的性能度量分三层，层间是<strong>归因链</strong>而非替代关系：基准告诉你「比谁快、快多少」，算子剖析器告诉你「时间花在哪个算子上」，PMU 计数器告诉你「为什么这个算子慢——是前端取指、后端执行还是内存墙」。</p>\n<p>剖析与基准度量的分工很明确。<strong>剖析</strong>回答「这段代码把时间花在哪里」，输入是一个具体查询与数据分布，输出对单次运行敏感、不可跨机器比较。<strong>基准</strong>回答「在固定负载下系统表现如何」，输入是标准化查询集合与数据集，可跨机器、跨版本、跨引擎比较，代价是它<strong>不解释</strong>任何结果。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[基准套件&lt;br/&gt;TPC-H / ClickBench&lt;br/&gt;端到端可复现指标] --&gt; B[定位到可疑查询]&#10;  B --&gt; C[引擎剖析器&lt;br/&gt;EXPLAIN ANALYZE / query_log&lt;br/&gt;算子级时间与基数]&#10;  C --&gt; D[定位到热点算子]&#10;  D --&gt; E[PMU 计数器&lt;br/&gt;perf stat / perf record&lt;br/&gt;IPC、cache-miss、topdown]&#10;  E --&gt; F{瓶颈归因}&#10;  F --&gt;|前端受限| G[分支预测 / 指令体积]&#10;  F --&gt;|后端受限| H[执行端口 / 依赖链]&#10;  F --&gt;|内存受限| I[带宽 / cache 未命中 / 物化]&#10;  F --&gt;|退休正常| J[已接近硬件上限&lt;br/&gt;换算法而非换指令]\">flowchart TD\n  A[基准套件&lt;br/&gt;TPC-H / ClickBench&lt;br/&gt;端到端可复现指标] --&gt; B[定位到可疑查询]\n  B --&gt; C[引擎剖析器&lt;br/&gt;EXPLAIN ANALYZE / query_log&lt;br/&gt;算子级时间与基数]\n  C --&gt; D[定位到热点算子]\n  D --&gt; E[PMU 计数器&lt;br/&gt;perf stat / perf record&lt;br/&gt;IPC、cache-miss、topdown]\n  E --&gt; F{瓶颈归因}\n  F --&gt;|前端受限| G[分支预测 / 指令体积]\n  F --&gt;|后端受限| H[执行端口 / 依赖链]\n  F --&gt;|内存受限| I[带宽 / cache 未命中 / 物化]\n  F --&gt;|退休正常| J[已接近硬件上限&lt;br/&gt;换算法而非换指令]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层</th>\n<th>代表工具</th>\n<th>度量的对象</th>\n<th>可跨引擎比较</th>\n<th>主要盲区</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>基准套件</td>\n<td>TPC-H、ClickBench、微基准</td>\n<td>端到端耗时、QphH、存储占用</td>\n<td>是（同硬件同调优）</td>\n<td>不解释原因，易被调优针对</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>引擎剖析器</td>\n<td>DuckDB <code>enable_profiling</code>、ClickHouse <code>query_log</code></td>\n<td>每算子耗时、基数、内存、溢写</td>\n<td>否（语义与粒度不同）</td>\n<td>采样/计时开销，并行下不可加</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>PMU 计数器</td>\n<td><code>perf stat</code> / <code>perf record</code></td>\n<td>IPC、cache-miss、分支、topdown</td>\n<td>是（同微架构）</td>\n<td>需符号与内核权限，受中断滑移影响</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>三层缺一不可：只看基准会陷入「换版本重跑」的盲目试错；只看 PMU 会知道某函数占 40% 却不知道它对查询是否必要；只看算子剖析会在「扫描算子占 70% 时间」时误判成优化空间巨大，而它可能已贴着内存带宽跑。</p>\n<h2 id=\"操作系统级-pmu-计数器与-perf-归因\">操作系统级：PMU 计数器与 perf 归因</h2><p>Linux 的 <code>perf</code> 直接读硬件性能监控单元（PMU）。<code>perf stat</code> 未指定事件时收集一组默认事件：软件侧 <code>task-clock</code>、<code>context-switches</code>、<code>page-faults</code>，硬件侧 <code>cycles</code>、<code>instructions</code>、<code>branches</code>、<code>branch-misses</code>，部分平台还带 <code>cache-references</code> 与 <code>cache-misses</code>（<code>https://perfwiki.github.io/main/tutorial/</code>）。默认输出在 <code>#</code> 后附带派生指标，最重要的是 <strong>IPC（每周期指令数）</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mtext>instructions</mtext><mtext>cycles</mtext></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">= \\frac{\\text{instructions}}{\\text{cycles}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.3669em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.3426em;vertical-align:-0.4811em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8615em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">cycles</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">instructions</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4811em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<p>IPC 是向量化引擎第一手诊断信号。同一条扫描查询，标量实现因逐行解释类型与边界，IPC 常在 0.5–1.0；切到向量化与 SIMD 后，若数据驻留 L2 且分支可预测，IPC 可爬到 2–3。反过来，<strong>IPC 高于 3 却仍慢</strong>，通常意味着瓶颈不在执行单元而在内存——此时该看 cache-miss 与带宽。诊断时用 <code>perf stat -e cycles,instructions,cache-misses,branch-misses -r 5</code> 对同一查询重复五次取抖动，因为单次运行的 cache 状态不可复现。定位到源码需要采样：<code>perf record</code> 默认以 <code>cycles</code> 事件、约 1000 Hz 频率采样（<code>-F</code> 可调），计数器溢出时抓取指令指针写入 <code>perf.data</code>；<code>perf report</code> 按函数降序排列，<code>[.]</code> 用户态、<code>[k]</code> 内核态。采样有<strong>中断滑移（skid）</strong>：记录的地址可能落在实际溢出指令之后几条，所以不能据一个占 2% 的热点做微优化。</p>\n<p>现代 x86 上更有价值的是 <strong>Top-down Microarchitecture Analysis（TMA）</strong>。<code>perf stat</code> 自动把一级 Topdown 分组呈现为四个互斥桶：<code>tma_retiring</code>（有用功）、<code>tma_frontend_bound</code>、<code>tma_bad_speculation</code>、<code>tma_backend_bound</code>，四者相加近似 100%。对向量化引擎，这四桶直接映射到四类根因：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong><code>tma_frontend_bound</code> 高</strong>：指令体积过大或分支预测失败。爆炸式展开的算子循环（每个类型组合一份模板实例）抬升前端压力。</li>\n<li><strong><code>tma_bad_speculation</code> 高</strong>：先查选择向量再解引用、<code>if (sel[i] &lt; n)</code> 这类依赖数据的判断打穿预测器；向量化的收益正是把这些逐行分支变成掩码运算。</li>\n<li><strong><code>tma_backend_bound</code> 高</strong>：执行端口或依赖链受限，整数除法、跨 lane 的 horizontal reduce 是典型。</li>\n<li><strong><code>tma_retiring</code> 高</strong>：已接近该微架构上限，换指令收益有限，应改算法——换连接顺序、提前过滤降基数、或改更适合的编码。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>PMU 计数需要内核 <code>perf_event_paranoid</code> 放宽与符号可达；容器与虚拟化环境常屏蔽 PMU 或只暴露软件事件，此时 IPC 不可得，应退回算子级剖析。</p>\n<h2 id=\"引擎级-算子剖析器的读数与陷阱\">引擎级：算子剖析器的读数与陷阱</h2><p>DuckDB 的剖析开关是 <code>PRAGMA enable_profiling</code>，输出格式默认 <code>query_tree</code>，可选 <code>json</code>、<code>query_tree_optimizer</code>、<code>no_output</code>；目的地由 <code>PRAGMA profiling_output</code> 指定，默认 <code>Console</code>。粒度由 <code>profiling_mode</code> 控制（<code>standard</code> / <code>detailed</code> / <code>all</code>）。自 v1.5.0 起可一次性配置：<code>CALL enable_profiling(format := &#39;json&#39;, save_location := &#39;/tmp/q.json&#39;, mode := &#39;standard&#39;)</code>，再用 <code>python -m duckdb.query_graph /tmp/q.json</code> 渲染成查询图（DuckDB 文档，Profiling 一节）。</p>\n<p><code>EXPLAIN ANALYZE</code> 输出每个算子的<strong>累计墙钟时间</strong>与估计基数（<code>EC:</code>）对照<strong>实际基数</strong>。两条读数纪律：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>并行下算子时间不可相加</strong>。文档明确说明并行执行时总查询时间可能小于各算子时间之和，因为多线程并发工作。把每算子时间加起来当总耗时是错误归因。</li>\n<li><strong><code>EC</code> 与实际基数的比值才是优化信号</strong>。两者差一个数量级说明统计信息或选择性估计失真，代价模型据此选错了连接顺序或算法——这是「慢」的根因，而非算子实现慢。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>ClickHouse 走另一条路：不产生剖析树，而是把每次查询写进 <code>system.query_log</code>。关键字段有 <code>query_duration_ms</code>、<code>read_rows</code>（含 <code>IN</code>/<code>JOIN</code> 子查询、跨副本聚合）、<code>read_bytes</code>、<code>memory_usage</code>、<code>result_rows</code>，以及 <code>ProfileEvents</code>（<code>Map(LowCardinality(String), UInt64)</code> 计数器集合，别名 <code>ProfileEvents.Names</code> / <code>.Values</code> 可拆开）。逐线程细节在 <code>system.query_thread_log</code>；<code>peak_threads_usage</code> 给出并发度，<code>spilled_to_disk</code> 直接列出发生溢写的算子——判断「是算子慢还是内存不够落盘」最快的字段。查完成的查询过滤 <code>type = &#39;QueryFinish&#39;</code> 并叠加 <code>is_initial_query = 1</code>；<code>log_queries_probability</code> 可采样，生产环境只对慢查询采样是最低成本的落地方式。</p>\n<p>取舍明确：DuckDB 剖析树适合<strong>单机、单查询、深入分析</strong>；ClickHouse 日志适合<strong>生产、持续、聚合观测</strong>，可长期留存做分位统计。两者都不提供 PMU 级归因。</p>\n<h2 id=\"基准度量-roi-可比性与三个常见陷阱\">基准度量：ROI、可比性与三个常见陷阱</h2><p>基准的第一原则是<strong>声明测什么</strong>。TPC-H 的官方主指标是 <code>QphH@Size</code>（Composite Query-per-Hour），同时反映三件事：数据库规模、单提交流的查询处理能力（Power 测试）、多并发用户的吞吐（Throughput 测试）；价格/性能在 V2 是 <code>Price/QphH@Size</code>，V3 把该值乘以 1000 归一为 <code>Price/kQphH@Size</code>（TPC 官方说明，<code>https://www.tpc.org/tpch/</code>）。选 TPC-H 意味着你在意混合复杂分析查询的端到端表现，并接受其规格约束（含 ACID 与数据加载时间规则）。</p>\n<p>ClickBench 刻意更轻：固定数据集 <strong>99,997,497 行</strong>、<strong>43 条查询</strong>，每条跑三次（冷跑/热跑），参考环境为 AWS EC2 <strong>c6a.4xlarge</strong> 搭配 <strong>500 GB gp2</strong> 磁盘，榜单以**相对时间（越低越好）**呈现，可按开源/闭源、CPU/GPU、是否调优过滤（ClickHouse ClickBench 仓库，<code>https://github.com/ClickHouse/ClickBench</code>）。它测窄表上的过滤聚合密集负载，与 TPC-H 的宽表多表连接互补而非替代。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>套件</th>\n<th>规模锚点</th>\n<th>查询数</th>\n<th>主指标</th>\n<th>适合回答</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>TPC-H</td>\n<td>官方 scale factor（如 SF100）</td>\n<td>22</td>\n<td><code>QphH@Size</code>（Power + Throughput）</td>\n<td>混合分析负载、并发吞吐</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ClickBench</td>\n<td>99,997,497 行</td>\n<td>43</td>\n<td>相对时间（冷/热/加载/存储）</td>\n<td>过滤聚合密集、读取延迟</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>微基准</td>\n<td>自定（如单算子 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>7</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10^7</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">7</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 行）</td>\n<td>自定</td>\n<td>每行纳秒 / 每字节周期</td>\n<td>单算子或指令路径上限</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>微基准是第三类，也最容易被误用。它的正确用途是<strong>验证单个算子是否达到硬件上限</strong>，而非预测端到端性能。判断是否触顶用 Roofline 模型（Williams、Waterman、Patterson，<em>Roofline: An Insightful Visual Performance Model for Multicore Architectures</em>，CACM 2009）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mtext>ach</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">(</mo><msub><mi>π</mi><mtext>peak</mtext></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>  </mtext><msub><mi>β</mi><mtext>mem</mtext></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mi>I</mi><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_{\\text{ach}} = \\min\\big(\\pi_{\\text{peak}},\\; \\beta_{\\text{mem}} \\cdot I\\big)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">ach</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">peak</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0528em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">mem</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>π</mi><mtext>peak</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pi_{\\text{peak}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">peak</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是峰值算力、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>β</mi><mtext>mem</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\beta_{\\text{mem}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0528em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">mem</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是可持续带宽、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span></span></span></span></span> 是<strong>操作强度</strong>（每搬运一字节执行的运算数）。过滤、投影这类算子的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span></span></span></span></span> 极低，必然落在带宽斜线上——此时唯一方向是减少搬运量（延迟物化、列裁剪、更紧的编码），而不是加宽 SIMD。</p>\n<p>三个反复出现的陷阱：</p>\n<p><strong>陷阱一：混淆「未调优」与「已调优」。</strong> 榜单的过滤维度正为此存在。跨引擎比较必须固定硬件、规模、并发度与预热策略，否则差异可能全来自缓存状态。</p>\n<p><strong>陷阱二：只看均值不看尾部分位。</strong> 分析查询的 P99 常由溢写与并行调度尾延迟决定。把「慢查询」分布与「溢写/物化边界」关联，才能区分「普遍慢」与「少数查询拖尾」。物化边界的串行阶段是尾延迟的结构性来源，其墙钟下界形如</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>wall</mtext></msub><mo>≥</mo><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>k</mi></munderover><munder><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mi>t</mi></munder><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>task</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>m</mi></munderover><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>spill</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>j</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\text{wall}} \\ge \\sum_{i=1}^{k} \\max_{t} T_{\\text{task}}(t, i) + \\sum_{j=1}^{m} T_{\\text{spill}}(j)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">wall</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.1138em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.8361em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop\">max</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">task</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.0652em;vertical-align:-1.4138em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.6514em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4138em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">spill</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>并行度只能压缩第一项，对溢写项无能为力——这解释了为何「核数翻倍、只快 20%」。</p>\n<p><strong>陷阱三：用剖析器测基准。</strong> 剖析器本身有采样与计时开销，且 <code>detailed</code> 模式会额外采集指标、显著改变运行时序。性能度量与基准计时必须分别在剖析关闭与开启两次运行中进行，且永远不要把剖析运行的数字当性能数字上报。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>度量分三层且构成归因链：基准定位置与幅度、算子剖析器定算子、PMU 计数器定硬件根因。任一单独层都会得出偏误结论。</li>\n<li><code>perf stat</code> 默认给出 IPC 与 cache 相关事件；<code>perf record</code> 默认以 <code>cycles</code> 约 1000 Hz 采样，有中断滑移；Topdown 四桶把归因映射到四类根因。</li>\n<li>DuckDB 剖析默认格式 <code>query_tree</code>、输出默认 <code>Console</code>，并行下算子时间<strong>不可相加</strong>，<code>EC</code> 与实际基数之差才是优化信号。ClickHouse 用 <code>system.query_log</code> 持续观测，<code>spilled_to_disk</code>、<code>peak_threads_usage</code> 是最快的诊断字段。</li>\n<li>TPC-H 主指标是 <code>QphH@Size</code>（Power + Throughput），ClickBench 以 99,997,497 行 / 43 查询 / EC2 c6a.4xlarge 参考环境给出相对时间；两者互补。</li>\n<li>用 Roofline（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>π</mi><mtext>peak</mtext></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>β</mi><mtext>mem</mtext></msub><mi>I</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P = \\min(\\pi_{\\text{peak}}, \\beta_{\\text{mem}} I)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">peak</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0528em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">mem</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>）判断算子是否触顶：低操作强度者受带宽约束，加宽 SIMD 无用，应减少数据搬运。</li>\n<li>三条纪律：固定硬件与预热再比较；看尾部分位而不只看均值；剖析计时与基准计时分开运行。</li>\n<li>单个算子是否值得 SIMD 加宽，见 <a href=\"../column-operators-simd/simd-operator-tuning-fallback\">SIMD 算子调优与回退路径</a>；把「选错流水线阶段」落到执行模型选择，见 <a href=\"../execution-model-evolution/execution-model-selection-migration\">执行模型选择与迁移</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"向量化引擎性能剖析与基准度量","id":"向量化引擎性能剖析与基准度量"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"操作系统级：PMU 计数器与 perf 归因","id":"操作系统级-pmu-计数器与-perf-归因"},{"level":2,"text":"引擎级：算子剖析器的读数与陷阱","id":"引擎级-算子剖析器的读数与陷阱"},{"level":2,"text":"基准度量：ROI、可比性与三个常见陷阱","id":"基准度量-roi-可比性与三个常见陷阱"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"向量化引擎架构与实现选型（DuckDB/Velox/ClickHouse）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/vectorized-query-execution-engine-simd/engine-implementation-ops/vectorized-engine-architecture"},"next":{"title":"生产运维：退化、资源隔离与兼容回退","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/vectorized-query-execution-engine-simd/engine-implementation-ops/production-degradation-fallback"}}